WEBVTT

00:00:08.120 --> 00:00:09.570
Gentle breeze.

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:18.100
Downward slope.

00:00:20.210 --> 00:00:21.450
How will you play it?

00:00:23.290 --> 00:00:24.710
I'll aim two cup-lengths to the left.

00:00:26.730 --> 00:00:30.710
<i>Aoi was born with two gifts.</i>

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:35.090
One was me. The blood of the Amawashi.

00:00:35.860 --> 00:00:39.890
The other was the blood 
of my husband, Kazuhiko Hodaka.

00:00:41.990 --> 00:00:47.220
<i>Those two gifts will take her to the top!</i>

00:00:51.480 --> 00:00:54.790
Amane, you're a lucky woman.

00:00:54.790 --> 00:00:57.200
<i>You'll be watching her closer than anyone</i>

00:00:59.210 --> 00:01:02.130
<i>as she makes a miracle happen.</i>

00:02:35.650 --> 00:02:41.590
You were able to handle 
the unique winds of Nafrece.

00:02:41.590 --> 00:02:42.720
If you keep it up...

00:02:45.120 --> 00:02:47.380
What? Jet lag kicking in late?

00:02:47.380 --> 00:02:48.990
That's not it.

00:02:48.990 --> 00:02:50.800
My heart's just not in it, I guess.

00:02:51.280 --> 00:02:55.650
Most of the best junior players 
at the world level are at least 16.

00:02:55.650 --> 00:03:00.250
Is the Under-15 World Championship 
not exciting enough for Aoi Amawashi?

00:03:00.250 --> 00:03:02.080
N-No...

00:03:05.090 --> 00:03:07.420
It's backed up. What do you want to do?

00:03:07.420 --> 00:03:08.730
Take a break—

00:03:23.010 --> 00:03:25.730
<i>That was over 240 yards.</i>

00:03:25.730 --> 00:03:27.490
<i>That's pro-level distance!</i>

00:03:27.770 --> 00:03:28.610
Who is that?

00:03:28.610 --> 00:03:30.250
Someone in the tournament?

00:03:30.850 --> 00:03:31.860
No...

00:03:32.530 --> 00:03:35.650
If someone was that good, 
I would've noticed them.

00:03:35.940 --> 00:03:39.690
T-That's Helene Robert!

00:03:40.250 --> 00:03:42.820
<i>The Nafrece Junior Champion!</i>

00:03:42.820 --> 00:03:44.960
<i>Why did she forfeit?</i>

00:03:44.960 --> 00:03:47.560
Is that Helene's practice partner?

00:03:47.970 --> 00:03:51.210
But that outfit...

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:51.200
Thanks for playing!

00:03:51.210 --> 00:03:53.300
She doesn't look like a golfer.

00:03:53.590 --> 00:03:54.450
Amane...

00:03:55.690 --> 00:03:57.350
She's amazing!

00:03:57.350 --> 00:03:58.340
Aoi?

00:03:58.340 --> 00:04:00.670
You saw her shot off the tee, right?

00:04:00.670 --> 00:04:04.100
It was like the ball glowed 
blue when the club hit it!

00:04:04.400 --> 00:04:07.570
I never imagined someone 
could hit a ball like that!

00:04:08.880 --> 00:04:10.680
W-Wait, Aoi!

00:04:11.990 --> 00:04:15.810
Would you like to play with me?

00:04:16.210 --> 00:04:17.020
Who are you?

00:04:17.560 --> 00:04:20.030
Aoi Amawashi.

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:23.280
I wouldn't mind. But how much will you bet?

00:04:23.930 --> 00:04:25.480
I won't bet.

00:04:26.080 --> 00:04:29.600
Golf is a sacred sport, 
and that would be an insult to it.

00:04:30.980 --> 00:04:32.120
I see.

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:32.580
Okay.

00:04:32.910 --> 00:04:34.000
Instead...

00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:37.510
I'll use this to get your interest.

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:41.130
<i>She's using that driver before 
the tournament's even started...</i>

00:04:42.520 --> 00:04:43.970
<i>Well, that's that.</i>

00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:47.230
<i>Once she gets like that, she doesn't stop.</i>

00:05:01.360 --> 00:05:03.200
<i>Now, what will you do?</i>

00:05:03.960 --> 00:05:05.960
<i>If I were you, I'd probably...</i>

00:05:06.980 --> 00:05:08.860
<i>No, I would definitely...</i>

00:05:09.450 --> 00:05:11.950
<i>Innocent Tyrant</i>

00:05:12.850 --> 00:05:15.440
Of course, I'll be happy to play.

00:05:15.440 --> 00:05:18.040
But what rules shall we use?

00:05:18.640 --> 00:05:21.970
Stroke play to the 18th hole?

00:05:21.970 --> 00:05:25.400
Sure. Let's have some fun.

00:05:25.400 --> 00:05:26.890
That's not possible, I'm afraid.

00:05:26.890 --> 00:05:29.880
It would have an impact 
on her practice schedule.

00:05:29.880 --> 00:05:32.230
If you want to know each other's skills,

00:05:32.230 --> 00:05:33.720
one hole should be enough, right?

00:05:35.200 --> 00:05:37.130
I'll tell the CEO on you.

00:05:38.260 --> 00:05:40.230
Would one hole be alright?

00:05:40.580 --> 00:05:42.700
Sure, I guess.

00:05:42.980 --> 00:05:46.020
Amane, what's the hardest 
hole on this course?

00:05:46.730 --> 00:05:47.980
You know the answer to that.

00:05:49.180 --> 00:05:50.680
Hole 14.

00:05:53.920 --> 00:05:58.250
<i>Hole 14, Par 5. 490 yards.</i>

00:05:59.030 --> 00:06:04.140
<i>The course is L-shaped with a thick 
forest between the tee and the hole.</i>

00:06:04.140 --> 00:06:07.510
<i>Taking a shortcut to the fairway 
past it is nigh-impossible.</i>

00:06:07.920 --> 00:06:13.010
<i>There's a steep hill at the corner, too,</i>

00:06:13.010 --> 00:06:16.020
<i>with three large bunkers below it.</i>

00:06:16.290 --> 00:06:18.290
<i>The usual way to play is to</i>

00:06:18.290 --> 00:06:22.930
<i>keep an eye on the slope and make sure 
you land between the two bunkers,</i>

00:06:22.930 --> 00:06:25.230
<i>leaving you with a clear path to the green.</i>

00:06:25.230 --> 00:06:29.130
<i>But that leaves more than 
270 yards to the cup,</i>

00:06:29.130 --> 00:06:31.430
<i>so getting to the green 
in 2 strokes is hard.</i>

00:06:31.430 --> 00:06:35.500
<i>If you can avoid the bunkers, 
it's possible to get a birdie.</i>

00:06:35.500 --> 00:06:37.410
<i>But if you want an eagle...</i>

00:06:37.970 --> 00:06:40.350
<i>you know what it'll take, Aoi.</i>

00:06:38.570 --> 00:06:40.350
Who goes first?

00:06:40.350 --> 00:06:41.760
You can go first.

00:06:41.970 --> 00:06:43.490
Thanks.

00:06:52.770 --> 00:06:54.100
<i>A shortcut?</i>

00:06:54.580 --> 00:06:56.790
<i>Is there some path through the woods?</i>

00:06:56.790 --> 00:06:57.860
<i>No,</i>

00:06:57.860 --> 00:07:01.230
<i>I ran countless simulations 
and couldn't find one.</i>

00:07:01.800 --> 00:07:06.470
<i>In other words, it's a reckless attack,</i>

00:07:06.470 --> 00:07:08.580
<i>born of a desire to win at all costs.</i>

00:07:10.440 --> 00:07:14.050
<i>I'll wipe that smirk off your face.</i>

00:07:14.050 --> 00:07:15.700
<i>With my bullet.</i>

00:07:16.390 --> 00:07:18.160
Direct Strike...

00:07:18.950 --> 00:07:21.410
Blue Bullet!

00:07:29.250 --> 00:07:31.190
<i>More... more!</i>

00:07:32.180 --> 00:07:33.900
<i>Go further!</i>

00:07:46.690 --> 00:07:49.860
<i>Estimated distance 210 yards.</i>

00:07:51.150 --> 00:07:53.700
<i>150 yards to the pin.</i>

00:07:53.940 --> 00:07:56.770
<i>She used nothing but brute strength.</i>

00:07:57.360 --> 00:07:59.340
<i>That's not how you're 
supposed to play golf...</i>

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:04.220
Nice shot! You surprised me!

00:08:04.780 --> 00:08:06.460
What are you grinning for?

00:08:06.770 --> 00:08:08.240
I'm happy!

00:08:08.240 --> 00:08:10.980
I'm gonna have to do my best to keep up!

00:08:12.720 --> 00:08:14.610
<i>You think you can win?</i>

00:08:14.610 --> 00:08:18.000
<i>Then show me... show me your golf!</i>

00:08:15.920 --> 00:08:19.200
I won't let you use the 48-incher.

00:08:19.200 --> 00:08:21.200
Use the normal driver.

00:08:21.200 --> 00:08:22.800
Yeah. I know.

00:08:23.190 --> 00:08:24.810
<i>She changed drivers?</i>

00:08:29.650 --> 00:08:32.450
<i>I'm really excited!</i>

00:08:33.010 --> 00:08:35.280
<i>When was the last time I was so excited?</i>

00:08:40.200 --> 00:08:44.440
<i>Maybe the last time I played with Father?</i>

00:08:46.560 --> 00:08:48.410
<i>It's reminding me again...</i>

00:08:48.410 --> 00:08:51.840
<i>how much fun golf is!</i>

00:08:56.350 --> 00:08:59.100
Aww, that was just a normal shot.

00:08:59.100 --> 00:09:00.890
No. That's...

00:09:03.170 --> 00:09:06.640
That trajectory... a slice shot!

00:09:17.050 --> 00:09:19.570
<i>Aoi was born with two gifts.</i>

00:09:23.010 --> 00:09:26.620
One was me. The blood of the Amawashi.

00:09:27.330 --> 00:09:30.370
<i>The other was the blood 
of my husband, the Hodaka blood.</i>

00:09:32.360 --> 00:09:38.670
<i>Those two gifts will take her to the top!</i>

00:09:40.930 --> 00:09:43.080
<i>No, CEO.</i>

00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:46.180
<i>She has a third gift.</i>

00:09:46.450 --> 00:09:50.940
<i>A heart that truly enjoys golf, 
and never feels pressure.</i>

00:09:51.280 --> 00:09:54.940
<i>An innocent smile that crushes 
the hearts of her opponents.</i>

00:09:56.780 --> 00:09:58.900
<i>The "Innocent Tyrant".</i>

00:10:03.650 --> 00:10:06.360
<i>How far did her shot go?</i>

00:10:06.360 --> 00:10:07.280
<i>How far...?</i>

00:10:12.220 --> 00:10:13.710
Eve! There!

00:10:17.380 --> 00:10:19.320
<i>It went that far?</i>

00:10:19.320 --> 00:10:21.550
<i>There's not even 140 yards left to the hole!</i>

00:10:21.550 --> 00:10:24.930
How'd it get that far?

00:10:25.560 --> 00:10:28.060
<i>Did she aim for it directly?</i>

00:10:28.450 --> 00:10:31.560
<i>Such a small spot... 
and she nailed it?</i>

00:10:31.960 --> 00:10:35.940
The person who created 
this course was really mean.

00:10:35.940 --> 00:10:40.590
The one chance at an 
eagle that the 14th Hole has.

00:10:40.590 --> 00:10:42.860
Good job finding it, Aoi.

00:10:44.360 --> 00:10:50.570
Well, you'll need that if you want 
any chance of winning the tournament.

00:10:51.560 --> 00:10:53.800
You don't need to judge distance, do you?

00:10:53.800 --> 00:10:55.800
It's your second shot.

00:10:55.800 --> 00:10:57.340
I know.

00:11:12.560 --> 00:11:14.960
Why are you following us?

00:11:16.580 --> 00:11:17.940
I want to watch!

00:11:18.470 --> 00:11:19.720
Is that okay?

00:11:20.040 --> 00:11:21.540
Whatever.

00:11:23.240 --> 00:11:24.350
Thank you!

00:11:26.740 --> 00:11:29.740
<i>It's her innocence, really...</i>

00:11:32.460 --> 00:11:35.210
<i>Eve</i>

00:11:35.400 --> 00:11:38.000
I can't see the green from here.

00:11:38.400 --> 00:11:40.340
What do we do, Eve?

00:11:40.680 --> 00:11:44.080
I'd do a slice through 
the trees on the right.

00:11:44.080 --> 00:11:45.100
Shut up.

00:11:45.460 --> 00:11:47.350
Sorry. I wasn't thinking...

00:11:50.660 --> 00:11:54.180
<i>I'll pierce through your heart...</i>

00:11:54.180 --> 00:11:55.680
<i>With this bullet...</i>

00:11:56.290 --> 00:11:57.880
<i>Heaven's...</i>

00:11:59.360 --> 00:12:00.860
<i>Red Bullet!</i>

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:07.030
Slip through!

00:12:11.730 --> 00:12:12.660
How about that?

00:12:14.470 --> 00:12:17.670
If only it had been a bit more to the right.

00:12:26.250 --> 00:12:27.820
<i>I missed.</i>

00:12:27.820 --> 00:12:32.240
<i>I couldn't get to the green! Why?</i>

00:12:33.320 --> 00:12:34.360
Well?

00:12:35.160 --> 00:12:39.260
How does it feel to have 
Aoi's smile crush you?

00:12:40.120 --> 00:12:42.520
<i>So it pierced me through?</i>

00:12:42.920 --> 00:12:48.770
<i>It pierced my heart through... 
ever since I saw her golf?</i>

00:12:50.290 --> 00:12:52.700
<i>Aoi</i>

00:12:54.160 --> 00:12:55.410
<i>A #9.</i>

00:12:55.690 --> 00:12:58.640
Why a #9 when there's 
still so much distance left?

00:12:58.640 --> 00:13:01.540
This is a fair match. No handicaps.

00:13:03.150 --> 00:13:05.190
<i>S-She's...</i>

00:13:06.000 --> 00:13:11.180
<i>I told you. She crushes you with her smile.</i>

00:13:11.850 --> 00:13:14.760
<i>The way she enjoys golf 
from the bottom of heart.</i>

00:13:14.760 --> 00:13:18.810
<i>No antagonism. No pressure 
can reach her smile.</i>

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:22.570
<i>That is the true power of Aoi Amawashi,</i>

00:13:27.880 --> 00:13:30.530
<i>the bearer of three gifts.</i>

00:13:32.410 --> 00:13:34.160
Looks like a #9...

00:13:37.420 --> 00:13:39.750
Wasn't quite enough.

00:13:40.620 --> 00:13:43.250
<i>This will crush her...</i>

00:13:45.480 --> 00:13:46.340
<i>She smiled.</i>

00:13:46.770 --> 00:13:48.390
You're really amazing.

00:13:48.390 --> 00:13:51.530
I've never seen anyone with your skills.

00:13:51.530 --> 00:13:52.940
Me too!

00:13:52.940 --> 00:13:56.970
I've never seen such 
creative, aggressive golf.

00:13:57.220 --> 00:13:59.370
I've never seen it before,

00:13:59.370 --> 00:14:02.440
but it feels like I know it somehow!

00:14:02.650 --> 00:14:05.440
What was your name again?

00:14:05.880 --> 00:14:08.580
Aoi. Aoi Amawashi.

00:14:08.580 --> 00:14:09.670
And you are?

00:14:09.670 --> 00:14:10.620
Eve.

00:14:10.620 --> 00:14:11.920
No last name.

00:14:11.920 --> 00:14:13.580
Just Eve.

00:14:14.160 --> 00:14:15.360
Eve.

00:14:15.360 --> 00:14:19.620
You're a shoo-in for that eagle.

00:14:21.810 --> 00:14:25.560
<i>Which means I can't win.</i>

00:14:25.560 --> 00:14:26.550
<i>But...</i>

00:14:26.550 --> 00:14:27.970
<i>I haven't lost yet.</i>

00:14:31.620 --> 00:14:34.820
<i>I haven't lost. Really...</i>

00:14:34.820 --> 00:14:37.580
<i>I'm in such dire straits.</i>

00:14:38.360 --> 00:14:41.650
<i>So why am I feeling it more than I ever have?</i>

00:14:44.000 --> 00:14:45.360
A putter?

00:14:45.360 --> 00:14:48.020
From that angle? How?

00:14:49.590 --> 00:14:50.830
I'm excited.

00:14:51.290 --> 00:14:55.600
I can't take my eyes off 
her golfing for a moment!

00:14:56.760 --> 00:14:59.030
<i>Don't think about missing.</i>

00:14:59.030 --> 00:15:01.370
<i>Aim for your target and devour it.</i>

00:15:01.370 --> 00:15:03.460
<i>Find what you want and steal it.</i>

00:15:03.460 --> 00:15:05.520
<i>That's my golf.</i>

00:15:05.520 --> 00:15:07.430
<i>My way of life.</i>

00:15:08.590 --> 00:15:10.040
<i>Insatiable...</i>

00:15:10.410 --> 00:15:12.050
<i>Green Bullet!</i>

00:15:17.280 --> 00:15:18.520
She whiffed.

00:15:20.420 --> 00:15:21.230
<i>No.</i>

00:15:22.200 --> 00:15:23.720
<i>It's going straight.</i>

00:15:25.690 --> 00:15:30.250
<i>Strong, straight golf that takes 
the shortest path to the cup.</i>

00:15:30.250 --> 00:15:30.860
<i>And that's why...</i>

00:15:33.180 --> 00:15:35.220
<i>I can't take my eyes off it!</i>

00:15:37.710 --> 00:15:38.920
It's too strong.

00:15:38.920 --> 00:15:39.790
It won't go in—

00:15:39.790 --> 00:15:40.680
It will.

00:15:41.940 --> 00:15:43.750
She wouldn't miss.

00:15:56.450 --> 00:16:00.010
<i>But well... I'm satisfied.</i>

00:16:02.560 --> 00:16:09.910
<i>This is the most fun 
I've ever had playing golf.</i>

00:16:13.740 --> 00:16:15.400
Come give it a try!

00:16:15.400 --> 00:16:20.640
Get the ball in the hole in one try 
and win 1000 eurus!

00:16:20.640 --> 00:16:22.130
100 eurus to try!

00:16:22.130 --> 00:16:24.130
Come on!

00:16:24.390 --> 00:16:25.430
Let me try.

00:16:25.430 --> 00:16:27.380
Thanks. Go for it!

00:16:35.620 --> 00:16:37.670
So close!

00:16:37.670 --> 00:16:38.970
One more try!

00:16:38.970 --> 00:16:41.520
Okay, good luck!

00:16:42.900 --> 00:16:46.060
<i>What an idiot! An absolute moron!</i>

00:16:46.060 --> 00:16:49.820
<i>You'd have to be a moron 
to not figure out it's rigged!</i>

00:16:50.990 --> 00:16:52.950
<i>There's a trick!</i>

00:16:54.400 --> 00:16:56.960
<i>A magnet in the ball!</i>

00:16:59.560 --> 00:17:00.920
Shit!

00:17:00.920 --> 00:17:04.820
Too bad! Try again sometime!

00:17:05.040 --> 00:17:07.410
<i>Dumbass!</i>

00:17:08.490 --> 00:17:10.710
Okay, new challenger!

00:17:10.710 --> 00:17:12.430
Wait, you're...

00:17:14.760 --> 00:17:16.930
Y-You can't just...

00:17:25.320 --> 00:17:26.570
1000 eurus.

00:17:26.570 --> 00:17:29.130
You can't play if you're 
in the same line of work!

00:17:29.130 --> 00:17:32.320
What are you doing? Are you stupid?

00:17:32.690 --> 00:17:34.070
1000 eurus.

00:17:34.690 --> 00:17:36.000
Listen to me...

00:17:36.250 --> 00:17:39.500
You don't have to pay. 
Just let me see the boss.

00:17:40.240 --> 00:17:42.060
Let me see Rose Aleon.

00:17:47.020 --> 00:17:48.660
Hey, Eve.

00:17:48.940 --> 00:17:54.630
I heard some Japanese junior 
golfer kicked your ass.

00:17:54.630 --> 00:17:56.450
How did you find out?

00:17:56.660 --> 00:17:58.860
Information is power.

00:17:58.860 --> 00:18:00.560
That goes for stocks. For politics.

00:18:00.560 --> 00:18:02.940
For earning "Nice" on social media.

00:18:02.940 --> 00:18:05.340
It's all information.

00:18:05.940 --> 00:18:10.220
<i>The Under-15 Women's World 
Championship ended its first day</i>

00:18:10.790 --> 00:18:15.270
<i>with Japanese golfer 
Aoi Amawashi in the lead.</i>

00:18:15.770 --> 00:18:19.540
<i>The others seemed to struggle 
with the unique Nafrece winds,</i>

00:18:19.540 --> 00:18:23.790
<i>but she earned five birdies and one eagle...</i>

00:18:23.790 --> 00:18:25.790
Aoi Amawashi.

00:18:26.160 --> 00:18:32.000
The only daughter of Seira Amawashi, 
an international-level pro player,

00:18:27.790 --> 00:18:30.250
<b>Seira 
Amawashi</b>

00:18:27.790 --> 00:18:30.250
<b>The Prizewinning Queen 
Doesn't Stop!</b>

00:18:32.020 --> 00:18:34.360
<b>Kazuhiko 
Hodaka</b>

00:18:32.020 --> 00:18:34.360
<b>The Man They Call 
the Monster</b>

00:18:32.420 --> 00:18:37.760
and Kazuhiko Hodaka, a male 
player they called "the Monster".

00:18:34.400 --> 00:18:36.370
<b>The Name of the Legend is</b>

00:18:34.400 --> 00:18:36.370
<b>Kazuhiko Hodaka</b>

00:18:37.760 --> 00:18:41.630
She's been given the best golf 
training possible from a very young age,

00:18:41.630 --> 00:18:43.760
and is an incredible player.

00:18:44.210 --> 00:18:47.150
This club is made by the Athena Brand.

00:18:47.150 --> 00:18:51.270
Seira Amawashi's the CEO of that company.

00:18:52.190 --> 00:18:57.440
You may not know much about golf, 
but you've seen this logo before.

00:18:58.300 --> 00:18:59.320
Well?

00:18:59.320 --> 00:19:02.100
Was that 1000 eurus worth of info?

00:19:02.100 --> 00:19:03.200
It's not enough.

00:19:04.770 --> 00:19:06.110
Give it up.

00:19:06.520 --> 00:19:09.760
We're criminals. 
We live outside the spotlight.

00:19:09.760 --> 00:19:13.410
And they live by all the little rules 
and regulations that we ignore.

00:19:13.410 --> 00:19:16.050
And she's super-rich, too.

00:19:16.050 --> 00:19:18.070
It's a miracle you ever 
even got to talk to her.

00:19:18.070 --> 00:19:20.960
I didn't come here 
to hear your opinion on it.

00:19:21.920 --> 00:19:25.100
You want to fight this 
Japanese girl that bad?

00:19:25.100 --> 00:19:26.180
Why?

00:19:28.840 --> 00:19:30.670
I lose.

00:19:30.670 --> 00:19:33.140
Kill me, eat me. Whatever you want.

00:19:35.350 --> 00:19:38.160
Then do one thing for me.

00:19:38.760 --> 00:19:40.030
What?

00:19:40.380 --> 00:19:43.990
Play another round with me.

00:19:44.490 --> 00:19:47.560
Not one hole. One round.

00:19:47.560 --> 00:19:49.190
With all your strength.

00:19:49.190 --> 00:19:51.620
I want to play golf with you.

00:19:52.440 --> 00:19:53.790
That's...

00:19:55.350 --> 00:19:56.540
It's a promise.

00:19:59.300 --> 00:20:00.840
Keep it.

00:20:02.880 --> 00:20:04.560
Why?

00:20:05.320 --> 00:20:08.140
Because I've got a good enough reason.

00:20:08.360 --> 00:20:11.430
You're not as stupid as you think you are.

00:20:11.430 --> 00:20:16.640
You came to me because you 
wanted my patron's help.

00:20:16.990 --> 00:20:24.700
Catherine. The main sponsor 
of the U15 Women's Championship.

00:20:25.390 --> 00:20:29.040
Of course, I'm willing to help.

00:20:29.380 --> 00:20:32.350
But you'll owe me big. Are you ready?

00:20:32.350 --> 00:20:33.760
I've always been ready.

00:20:35.370 --> 00:20:40.550
Ever since that day, 
it aches here. And it won't stop.

00:20:40.550 --> 00:20:43.970
It feels like if I don't do 
something, it's gonna blow...

00:20:44.640 --> 00:20:47.490
So the bullet's loaded, then?

00:20:47.490 --> 00:20:48.600
Yeah.

00:20:49.870 --> 00:20:53.220
All that's left is to pull the trigger.

00:22:23.840 --> 00:22:27.480
<i>The last day of the U15 
Women's Championship.</i>

00:22:27.960 --> 00:22:32.750
<i>Aoi Amawashi, the current leader, 
starts with the last group.</i>

00:22:33.580 --> 00:22:36.370
Group six is about to start.

00:22:36.370 --> 00:22:38.290
You're number nine.

00:22:38.290 --> 00:22:40.400
Let's get ready.

00:22:40.400 --> 00:22:42.090
Yes, that's right.

00:22:42.090 --> 00:22:44.600
<i>She's not feeling 
the slightest bit of pressure.</i>

00:22:44.920 --> 00:22:48.580
<i>And she's seven below 
the second-ranked player.</i>

00:22:48.580 --> 00:22:51.440
<i>Victory is within her grasp.</i>

00:22:54.170 --> 00:22:55.930
What is it, Aoi?

00:22:57.490 --> 00:22:58.220
Aoi!

00:23:05.110 --> 00:23:07.440
<i>I'm sure of it! It's her!</i>

00:23:08.050 --> 00:23:11.150
<i>Not one hole. One round.</i>

00:23:11.150 --> 00:23:12.450
<i>With all your strength.</i>

00:23:12.450 --> 00:23:14.560
<i>I want to play golf with you.</i>

00:23:17.290 --> 00:23:19.280
<i>She kept her promise!</i>

00:23:21.810 --> 00:23:23.430
<i>I can see it again...</i>

00:23:24.250 --> 00:23:25.670
<i>Her golf...</i>

00:23:28.180 --> 00:23:29.510
<i>That blue...</i>

00:23:36.120 --> 00:23:37.800
<i>...blue bullet!</i>

00:23:40.060 --> 00:23:50.070
Next Episode

00:23:40.930 --> 00:23:43.750
I'm finally playing a full game against Eve!

00:23:43.750 --> 00:23:47.320
When we finish the last hole, we can get food together 
and enjoy some girl talk in the bath!

00:23:47.320 --> 00:23:49.790
I've got to make sure I make my birdie!
